Still 1.2.0. The countdown no longer counts when nothing is counting.

A rider watched a thirty-second cooldown reach zero while no cooldown was running — my fault, from the smoothing added two builds ago, which drained the bar on its own once the counter stopped. It now interpolates within one second and no further.

The bar is also drawn only when a silence is really being counted. The microphone can be open with nothing counting, and that now says "Microphone open".
